  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates><x>1861</x><y>50</y><w>283</w><h>86</h></coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>State pattern: Context. It delegates
every stage change to currentState.
States only validate;
ApplicationService persists.</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates><x>3747</x><y>50</y><w>298</w><h>86</h></coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Observer pattern: Subject (Publisher).
DeadlineScheduler triggers
checkDeadlines() on a timer; observers
react to events.</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
